stays robust.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS5.SSS0.Px2" title="In 4.5 Can ThinC Recover from Code Failures Without NL Reasoning? ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Teaching Language Models to Think in Code" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Partial robustness from the format, the rest from RL.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Teaching Language Models to Think in Code" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Discussion and Conclusion</span></a></li>
