<section id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Turn 2: Self-correction in code.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Conditioning on Turn 1’s output, the model revisits its loop bound
and formalises the monotonicity argument (<math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=a+b(1{+}a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=a+b(1{+}a)</annotation></semantics></math> is monotone
in <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>b</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b</annotation></semantics></math> for fixed <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>a</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a</annotation></semantics></math>) directly as a code comment, then reruns with
the corrected condition. The audit and fix occur entirely within the
code lines; no NL reasoning between blocks is required.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="60.84" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 60.84" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,60.84) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#737373;" fill="#737373" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.32 L 0 57.52 C 0 59.35 1.49 60.84 3.32 60.84 L 474.06 60.84 C 475.89 60.84 477.38 59.35 477.38 57.52 L 477.38 3.32 C 477.38 1.49 475.89 0 474.06 0 L 3.32 0 C 1.49 0 0 1.49 0 3.32 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F8F8F4;" fill="#F8F8F4" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.55 3.32 L 0.55 25.65 L 476.82 25.65 L 476.82 3.32 C 476.82 1.79 475.58 0.55 474.06 0.55 L 3.32 0.55 C 1.79 0.55 0.55 1.79 0.55 3.32 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 7.26 30.14)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:30.41em;--ltx-fo-height:1.89em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="26.21" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 26.21)" width="420.79"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
