<section id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Turn 3: Structural sanity check.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The model decomposes the
result by parity to confirm there is no off-by-one error in the
value set.</p>
</div>
