<section id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Turn 4: Independent re-derivation.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The model re-implements
the count in the dual formulation <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(u,v)=(a{+}1,b{+}1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(u,v)=(a{+}1,b{+}1)</annotation></semantics></math> and verifies
that it matches Turn 2.</p>
</div>
