</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 10.03 9.68)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.73em;--ltx-fo-height:2.9em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.07em;font-size:10pt;" height="41.11" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 40.07)" width="494.4"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px5.p4.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:35.73em;">
<span id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px5.p4.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px5.p4.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;answer&gt;<span id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px5.p4.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif"> The final answer is <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px5.p4.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{70}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">70</mn></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{70}</annotation></semantics></math> </span>&lt;/answer&gt;<span id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px5.p4.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif">
</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.4 </span>What This Trajectory Illustrates</h3>

<div id="A1.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The rollout exhibits, in a single sample, the four behaviours that
the <span id="A1.SS4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ThinC</span> format establishes by construction:</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS4.p2" class="ltx_para">
<dl id="A1.I2" class="ltx_description">
<dt id="A1.I2.ix1" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I2.ix1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Strategy-only <math id="A1.I2.ix1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{1}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A1.I2.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The think channel carries a
single algebraic insight (<math id="A1.I2.ix1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a+b+ab=(a{+}1)(b{+}1)-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a+b+ab=(a{+}1)(b{+}1)-1</annotation></semantics></math>) and the
search constraints, with no arithmetic performed in NL. This
realises the <span id="A1.I2.ix1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ThinC</span> constraint that <math id="A1.I2.ix1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> expresses
strategy rather than derivation
(Section <a href="#S3.SS1" title="3.1 ThinC Reasoning ‣ 3 ThinC: Teaching Models to Think in Code ‣ Teaching Language Models to Think in Code" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.1</span></a>).</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A1.I2.ix2" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I2.ix2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Code as the reasoner.</span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A1.I2.ix2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.ix2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Every reasoning step from
Turn 1 onward is performed in code. Self-correction (Turn 2),
structural verification (Turn 3), independent re-derivation
(Turn 4), and complement audit (Turn 5) all occur within
<span id="A1.I2.ix2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;python&gt;</span> blocks; NL appears only as inline code comments
and never between code blocks.</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A1.I2.ix3" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I2.ix3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Conditioning on execution outputs.</span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A1.I2.ix3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.ix3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Turn 2’s repair
is grounded in the model’s audit of Turn 1’s output. Each
subsequent turn similarly conditions on <math id="A1.I2.ix3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="o_{&lt;i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">o_{&lt;i}</annotation></semantics></math>, consistent with
the formal trajectory structure in Eq. <a href="#S3.E6" title="In 3.1 ThinC Reasoning ‣ 3 ThinC: Teaching Models to Think in Code ‣ Teaching Language Models to Think in Code" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div></dd>
<dt id="A1.I2.ix4" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I2.ix4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Code-grounded final answer.</span></span></dt>
<dd class="ltx_item">
<div id="A1.I2.ix4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.ix4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The committed answer
(<math id="A1.I2.ix4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="70" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>70</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">70</annotation></semantics></math>) appears in the interpreter output of Turns 2, <math id="A1.I2.ix4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>4</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">4</annotation></semantics></math>, and
<math id="A1.I2.ix4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>5</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5</annotation></semantics></math>, rather than being generated in NL.</p>
</div></dd>
</dl>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS4.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS4.p3.1" class="ltx_p">This rollout is the qualitative correlate of the quantitative gap
between <span id="A1.SS4.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ThinC</span>-4B and interleaved TIR baselines in
Table <a href="#S4.T1" title="Table 1 ‣ 4.1 Experimental Setup ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Teaching Language Models to Think in Code" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> and the <math id="A1.SS4.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="99.2\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>99.2</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">99.2\%</annotation></semantics></math> code-grounded answer rate
reported in Section <a href="#S4.SS4" title="4.4 Does ThinC Actually Think in Code? ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Teaching Language Models to Think in Code" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.4</span></a>: the policy has learned
to confine NL to strategic planning and to carry out all subsequent
reasoning in code.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Few-Shot Prompt for Trajectory Distillation</h2>

<section id="A2.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.1 </span>Few-Shot Prompt for Trajectory Distillation</h3>

<div id="A2.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This appendix presents the full <math id="A2.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>3</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3</annotation></semantics></math>-shot prompt used to elicit
<span id="A2.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ThinC</span> trajectories from the teacher model
(Qwen3.5-27B).</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS1.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="57.25" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 57.25" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,57.25) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#CCCCCC;" fill="#CCCCCC" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.63 L 0 52.62 C 0 55.18 2.07 57.25 4.63 57.25 L 472.75 57.25 C 475.3 57.25 477.38 55.18 477.38 52.62 L 477.38 4.63 C 477.38 2.07 475.3 0 472.75 0 L 4.63 0 C 2.07 0 0 2.07 0 4.63 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 4.63 L 0.69 35.69 L 476.68 35.69 L 476.68 4.63 C 476.68 2.45 474.92 0.69 472.75 0.69 L 4.63 0.69 C 2.45 0.69 0.69 2.45 0.69 4.63 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 43.01)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.56em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="436.7"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS1.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:31.56em;">
<span id="A2.SS1.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Few-shot prompt</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 14.96)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.56em;--ltx-fo-height:0.64em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.18em;font-size:10pt;" height="11.38" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.92)" width="436.7"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS1.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:31.56em;">
<span id="A2.SS1.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F9F9F9;"><span class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></span>
<span id="lstnumberx42" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx42.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You</span><span id="lstnumberx42.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx42.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">are</span><span id="lstnumberx42.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx42.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">a</span><span id="lstnumberx42.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx42.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">math</span><span id="lstnumberx42.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx42.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">problem</span><span id="lstnumberx42.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx42.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">solver</span><span id="lstnumberx42.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx42.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">that</span><span id="lstnumberx42.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx42.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">works</span><span id="lstnumberx42.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx42.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">exclusively</span><span id="lstnumberx42.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx42.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">through</span><span id="lstnumberx42.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx42.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Python</span>
</span>
<span id="lstnumberx43" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx43.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">code</span><span id="lstnumberx43.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx43.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">execution</span><span id="lstnumberx43.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span>
</span>
<span id="lstnumberx44" class="ltx_listingline">
</span>
<span id="lstnumberx45" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx45.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Rules</span><span id="lstnumberx45.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">:</span>
</span>
<span id="lstnumberx46" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx46.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1.</span><span id="lstnumberx46.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx46.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Write</span><span id="lstnumberx46.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx46.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Python</span><span id="lstnumberx46.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx46.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">code</span><span id="lstnumberx46.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx46.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">inside</span><span id="lstnumberx46.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx46.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;</span><span id="lstnumberx46.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">python</span><span id="lstnumberx46.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&gt;</span><span id="lstnumberx46.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx46.15" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;/</span><span id="lstnumberx46.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">python</span><span id="lstnumberx46.17" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&gt;</span><span id="lstnumberx46.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx46.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">tags</span><span id="lstnumberx46.20" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span><span id="lstnumberx46.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx46.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You</span><span id="lstnumberx46.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx46.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">will</span><span id="lstnumberx46.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx46.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">receive</span>
</span>
<span id="lstnumberx47" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx47.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">   </span><span id="lstnumberx47.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">execution</span><span id="lstnumberx47.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx47.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">results</span><span id="lstnumberx47.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx47.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">inside</span><span id="lstnumberx47.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx47.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;</span><span id="lstnumberx47.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">result</span><span id="lstnumberx47.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&gt;</span><span id="lstnumberx47.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx47.12" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;/</span><span id="lstnumberx47.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">result</span><span id="lstnumberx47.14" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&gt;</span><span id="lstnumberx47.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;-