<section id="A5.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span>Reinforcement Learning</h3>

<div id="A5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Following DAPO <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib17" title="" class="ltx_ref">21</a>]</cite>, we
apply token-level loss normalization across the rollout group,
asymmetric clipping with <math id="A5.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon_{\mathrm{low}}=0.20" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>low</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon_{\mathrm{low}}=0.20</annotation></semantics></math> and
<math id="A5.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon_{\mathrm{high}}=0.28" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>high</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.28</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon_{\mathrm{high}}=0.28</annotation></semantics></math>, and disable the KL penalty.
Table <a href="#A5.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ E.2 Reinforcement Learning ‣ Appendix E Training Details ‣ Teaching Language Models to Think in Code" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> lists the full hyperparameter
configuration along with the three-stage curriculum.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A5.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>RL hyperparameters for <span id="A5.T4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ThinC</span>-1.7B and
<span id="A5.T4.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ThinC</span>-4B.</figcaption>
